  "title": "Init Code Hash Mismatch between `Launchpad::pairFor` and `GTELaunchpadV2PairFactory::createPair`  Causes Incorrect Pair Address Calculations Leading to complete brick of Token Graduation Process and Funds Lock Risk",
  "severity": "high",
