LaunchToken, pairAddress: 0xd370E4bF0dD427FDA9B0c686748615039376e46D)\n```\n\n- Mismatch: Launchpad thinks the pair is at `0xd370...` but in reality it’s at `0x8101...`\n\n3. Graduation Step Bricks\n\nWhen the Launchpad tries to interact with its computed pair address, it calls a non-contract address:\n\n```css\n← [Revert] call to non-contract address 0xd370E4bF0dD427FDA9B0c686748615039376e46D\n```\n\nThis is the direct consequence of the salt mismatch bug — the Launchpad is pointing at an address where no pair contract exists.",
